++/* Whether mesh shaders that output points or lines take this path too: EDEN_UP_RADV_MESH_POINTS in
++ * env.txt (port of zortos293/Lichii bc45e10, PR #863 by nemiward). 1: points and lines, a point
++ * keeping the size its program writes; 2: as 1, and a triangle program that writes a point size too
++ * (the size is left out, triangles have none). 0 (unset or anything else): only triangles, as
++ * before. Needs EDEN_NX2_RADV_MESH_COMPUTE=1, and the core needs EDEN_NX2_MESH_POINTS=1 to compile
++ * point and line programs at all. */
++unsigned radv_mesh_compute_points(void);
